#: ../../functions/func_pad.rst:6
msgid "$pad"
msgstr ""

#: ../../functions/func_pad.rst:8
msgid "Usage: **$pad(text,length,character)**"
msgstr "用法：**$pad(text,length,character)**"

#: ../../functions/func_pad.rst:9
msgid "Category: text"
msgstr "类别：文本"

#: ../../functions/func_pad.rst:11
msgid "**Description:**"
msgstr "**描述：**"

#: ../../functions/func_pad.rst:13
msgid "Pads the ``text`` to the ``length`` provided by adding as many copies of ``character`` as needed to the beginning of the string. For the padded length to be correct, ``character`` must be exactly one character in length. If ``length`` is less than the number of characters in ``text``, the function will return ``text``. If ``length`` is missing or is not a number, the function will return an empty string."
msgstr ""
"在字符串开头添加所需数量的 ``character`` 复本，以将 ``text`` 填充到 "
"``length`` 提供的长度。为了使填充长度正确，``character`` 必须正好是一个字符长"
"度。如果 ``length`` 小于 ``text`` 中的字符数，函数将返回 ``text``。如果 "
"``length`` 缺失或不是数字，函数将返回空字符串。"

